(7445503, 1177313, 103142, '<td valign="top">It was a really nice shot, but the filter on the sky, and then the problem with the selection around the trees (red on the horizon, grey/blue behind the trees) just ruins the shot for me. It could have been so good without the processing of the sky.</td>', 'It was a really nice shot, but the filter on the sky, and then the problem with the selection around the trees (red on the horizon, grey/blue behind the trees) just ruins the shot for me. It could have been so good without the processing of the sky.', '2016-03-22 22:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
