(7445540, 1177642, 140305, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon Wendy!  Just looking at the front page and seeing Elena''s to the left of your image - makes an interesting combination as they reflect each other :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-03-23 17:20:08.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon Wendy!  Just looking at the front page and seeing Elena''s to the left of your image - makes an interesting combination as they reflect each other :)', '2016-03-23 01:38:00.000000', '2016-03-23 17:20:08.000000', 0),
(7445555, 1177511, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>That''s certainly some S-curve! Your defined areas of sharpness and softness are very effective they certainly make the most important elements of your subject stand out nicely. The nest building action adds interest to the shot and I find the low contrast between the bird and the sky background appealing too. It might have een even more effective without the other bird in the background or if he were in a better position and more recognisable.<br/> <br/>Another excellent entry Janine, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the Critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. That''s certainly some S-curve! Your defined areas of sharpness and softness are very effective they certainly make the most important elements of your subject stand out nicely. The nest building action adds interest to the shot and I find the low contrast between the bird and the sky background appealing too. It might have een even more effective without the other bird in the background or if he were in a better position and more recognisable. Another excellent entry Janine, well done.', '2016-03-23 06:24:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445568, 1177541, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2016-03-23 08:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445569, 1177390, 70661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Congrats!</td>', 'Beautiful! Congrats!', '2016-03-23 08:49:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445578, 1177541, 103142, '<td valign="top">Haha!! I''ve been getting annoyed with all of the slanted horizons in recent shots. But as soon as I saw this, I thought: "Someone who knows how to tilt a horizon with a purpose, instead of by mistake." It adds a lot to it, and does give a sense of movement and dizziness. It wouldn''t have been nearly as interesting without it!<br/> <br/>Way to go out and get a shot! Congrats on the blue!</td>', 'Haha!! I''ve been getting annoyed with all of the slanted horizons in recent shots. But as soon as I saw this, I thought: "Someone who knows how to tilt a horizon with a purpose, instead of by mistake." It adds a lot to it, and does give a sense of movement and dizziness. It wouldn''t have been nearly as interesting without it! Way to go out and get a shot! Congrats on the blue!', '2016-03-23 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445579, 1177390, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very lovely and effective! Just perfect, imo. Congrats on the red!</td>', 'Very lovely and effective! Just perfect, imo. Congrats on the red!', '2016-03-23 09:33:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445580, 1177349, 103142, '<td valign="top">What a lovely spot! Nicely captured. Makes me wish I was on that bridge. :)<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'What a lovely spot! Nicely captured. Makes me wish I was on that bridge. :) Congrats on the HM!', '2016-03-23 09:35:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445581, 1177632, 103142, '<td valign="top">What a marvelous spot! Nice find and nice capture. I love looking at all the details. Congrats on the HM!</td>', 'What a marvelous spot! Nice find and nice capture. I love looking at all the details. Congrats on the HM!', '2016-03-23 09:36:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445582, 1177511, 103142, '<td valign="top">I want to goooooo!!!!!<br/> <br/>When''s our trip to gatorland? Where are we going this time? How are the burrowing owls?</td>', 'I want to goooooo!!!!! When''s our trip to gatorland? Where are we going this time? How are the burrowing owls?', '2016-03-23 09:37:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445583, 1177589, 103142, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene! Warm and happy.</td>', 'Lovely scene! Warm and happy.', '2016-03-23 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445585, 1177641, 103142, '<td valign="top">This was my top scoring shot. Most S-curves tend to lead the eye to nothing, and while pretty, come up flat, imo. This was fun, because it led me up to the top of the photo, but then the cars on the other side led me back down. It just draws you in and keeps you in a little mobius strip. There''s something that I find fascinating about it. Nicely done!</td>', 'This was my top scoring shot. Most S-curves tend to lead the eye to nothing, and while pretty, come up flat, imo. This was fun, because it led me up to the top of the photo, but then the cars on the other side led me back down. It just draws you in and keeps you in a little mobius strip. There''s something that I find fascinating about it. Nicely done!', '2016-03-23 09:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7445599, 1177642, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very cool that you went with monochrome. Sensual IS the word :)</td>', 'Very cool that you went with monochrome. Sensual IS the word :)', '2016-03-23 10:42:01.000000', NULL, 0),
